    "sentence_translations": [
      "7. Is the Apple Tasty?",
      "",
      "Zuoge didn’t say anything and finished eating the apple in his hand.",
      "He was not very happy and said, “This apple is not tasty at all.",
      "There is a fruit store next to my house. The apples sold there are tastier than this apple.",
      "I bought some a few days ago. There is still one in the car. You wait, I’ll look for it.”",
      "",
      "Sanjie asked, “Really? It’s even tastier than my apples?”",
      "",
      "Zuoge said, “You’ll know when you eat it. Here it is! Here, here you go, eat it.”",
      "",
      "Zuoge took the apple from the car to give to Sanjie. This was the apple that Sanjie gave to him last night.",
      "",
      "Sanjie smiled and said, “Okay.”",
      "",
      "As she ate the apple, Zuoge asked her, “Is the apple from the fruit store tasty?”",
      "",
      "Sanjie said, “It’s tasty.”",
      "",
      "Zuoge laughed, and Sanjie quickly finished eating the apple."
    ]
  }
